# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw source data: never committed. All of it is re-fetchable or re-derivable.
# See DATA.md for how to regenerate every excluded path.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The 732 cached WRD daily report PDFs (~195 MB). Re-fetchable from the source
# in one command; the ledger records the SHA-256 of every one, so a regenerated
# cache is verifiable against what this analysis actually read.
data/raw/

# Parsed intermediates: one parquet per day for storage and rainfall, plus the
# download ledger. Derived from data/raw/ with no network access.
data/interim/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Derived binaries and large artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.parquet
*.mbtiles
*.pmtiles

# Archived viewer screenshots (~11 MB of full-resolution PNG). Kept locally,
# out of git: they document a map whose tiles are too large to deploy anyway,
# and DATA.md already states the archive bulk is excluded. Regenerate by
# serving archive/web/ against a local tile build.
archive/web/screenshots/
*.dta
*.gpkg
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kept deliberately, despite the patterns above
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The small derived CSV/JSON in data/processed/ ARE committed: they are the
# audit trail the brief and README cite (capacity restatements, the three
# mid-season exceptions, season capacities, the pinned changeover dates).
# The rule is size and reproducibility, not "derived" as such.
!data/processed/*.csv
!data/processed/*.json
!data/reference/*

# The deployed site is committed in full — it is the artefact.
!web/**

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.err
.claude/

# Run logs from every script land here rather than beside the data they
# produced. Transient; never committed.
logs/
data/processed/GATE_TRIPPED.txt
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.venv/
venv/
